.83, "timestamp": "01:49:43", "text": "25,000 のようなものではなく、そういうことではない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6587.83, "timestamp": "01:49:47", "text": "常に 10 20 20 10,000 20,000 30,000"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6590.149, "timestamp": "01:49:50", "text": "40,000とか、その中間みたいな感じですね。それで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6592.39, "timestamp": "01:49:52", "text": "現金を引き出す場合は、必ず"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6592.406, "timestamp": "01:49:52", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "bruh I really want that grilled eel from japan. If I ever it's gonna be for the food too haha"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6593.99, "timestamp": "01:49:53", "text": "それらを覚えておけば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6596.07, "timestamp": "01:49:56", "text": "これで、あなたの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6598.79, "timestamp": "01:49:58", "text": "銀行取引の方法、それをどのように使用するか、"}]